	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuas recepi literas scriptas 20. et 23. huius mensis nec facile <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>adduci possum, ut credam <placeName ref="l18">Augustane</placeName> confessionis principes <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ex <placeName ref="l496">Stutgardia</placeName> discessisse nec ante collocutos de consilio et religionis temporibus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Deus est, qui principum corda moderatur, et fortior est mundo et Sathana <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nec suos deseret, quibus tanta contulit beneficia; hic contundet nimis iam incitatam exultantemque ferociam.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Que intelligo de apparatu ad bellum minime omnium necessarium in <placeName ref="l862">Helvetia</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>graviter, ut debeo, molesteque fero, spero tamen bonos et prudentes viros, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>qui sunt per singulos Pagos, nihil pretermissuros, ut omnia componantur, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ne fabula fiant et exponantur iniuriis eorum, qui male illis volunt.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Ego vero in eam cogitationem incubui, ut moneam omnes et pericula, in <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quę se coniiciant manifestem, et quia non potero adesse comitiis, mittam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>unum ex regis interpretibus cum literis satis diffusis, et que afficere, lenire <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>et movere debebunt quantumvis barbaros.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p20184">Bolvilerum</persName> accepi pecuniam mutuo <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sumpsisse a <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensibus</placeName>, non ut colligeret militem, sed ut redderet decem milia <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>florenorum dominis a <placeName>Rinach</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. <bibl source="b458">NDBA</bibl> XXXI ....</note>, quibus oppignoraverat terram <placeName>Florimontem</placeName> prope <placeName ref="l327">Monbeliardum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Sed nulli conatus valent contra dominum aut suos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Puto <placeName ref="l832">Gallicos</placeName> tumultus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>evanuisse et regem <placeName ref="l1209">Navarre</placeName> facturum, quod se decet, sine periculo.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Non dubito, quin <persName ref="p18575">Philippus</persName> obtulerit militem <placeName ref="l875">Hispanum</placeName> regi, sed non erit opus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>nec esset e re regni <placeName>Gallie</placeName> illum recipere.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Legatio etiam <placeName ref="l875">Hispana</placeName> non impediet, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>puto, nationale consilium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Vult pontifex <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentinum</placeName> continuari, quod christiani <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>principes non probant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sanlaurentianus est, ut nosti, in scribendo negligens; <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>eius literas expecto et de <placeName ref="l832">Gallie</placeName> rebus et de omnibus certiorem te faciam, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>que digna erunt.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Tu idem prestabis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Scribo hospiti <persName>Ciconię</persName> ut tuas <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>et aliorum literas semper includat in ali papiro et inscriptionem ponat Germanice, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ut citius ad me perferantur; ni putarem id facturum et statim, ubi eas <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>receperit, missurum, alteri committerem id negocii, qui etiam haberet stipendium.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Amicis salutem cum foenore rescribo(-as?).</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l760">Sol[uturi]</placeName> 27. octobris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p629">Coignetius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Intellex<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>i octo insignia lansquenetorum <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>collecta circum Lacum <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensem</placeName>... <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>uno ab <placeName>Embs</placeName> ductore et contra <placeName ref="l1121">Genuenses</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Post has scriptas magis revocavi ad animum, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>que scripsisti et que maior par[s] <placeName ref="l2450">Svitensium</placeName> constituit.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Itaque omnino decrevi cras <placeName ref="l21">Badenam</placeName> proficisci, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ubi nihil omnino pretermittam, que ad pacem <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>retinendam et conficiendam oportuna erunt.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Ibi iucundum mihi erit literas abs te recipere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="author">[von anderer Hand:]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>An herren <persName ref="p495">Heinrichen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullinger</persName>, verkünder des <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>göttlichen worts der statt <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, sinem günstigen, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>lieben fründt.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
